<title>UK: Details of North London rail franchise due Friday.</title>
<headline>Details of North London rail franchise due Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Details of the North London Railways passenger franchise will be announced at a press conference on Friday, said the Office of Passenger Rail Franchising late Thursday.</p>
<p>National Express, the UK transport group has already been named as preferred bidder. The announcement from Opraf will include details of the government subsidy levels payable to National Express, the minimum passenger service levels and how the business will be developed under the franshisee.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
